     <div class="cv114-muted">Role-based access • object ownership • mass-assignment protection • authorization testing</div></div>
     <span class="cv114-pill cv114-info">AUTHZ 11.4</span>
   </div>
   <div class="cv114-grid">
     <div class="cv114-kpi"><span class="cv114-muted">Authorization rules</span><b>7</b></div>
     <div class="cv114-kpi"><span class="cv114-muted">Supported roles</span><b>3</b></div>
     <div class="cv114-kpi"><span class="cv114-muted">IDOR protection</span><b>ENABLED</b></div>
     <div class="cv114-kpi"><span class="cv114-muted">Secret exposure</span><b>BLOCKED</b></div>
   </div>
