            6. <b>Route optimization</b>: nearest-neighbour ordering by straight-line (haversine) distance — not real road routing or live traffic.<br>
            7. All of this is a <b>deterministic prototype heuristic</b>, not a trained machine-learning model.</p>
            <p><b>REAL DEVICE DATA</b> — none connected. <b>PROTOTYPE IoT DATA</b> — Phase 6 simulation. <b>ASSUMPTION DATA</b> — Phase 5/7 population model. <b>PROTOTYPE AI OUTPUT</b> — everything on this page.</p>
