    <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);">
      ${isCbe ? 'CLENVIRO pilot / demo deployment zone.' : 'CLENVIRO has no operational or demo data for this district yet.'}
      See the <a onclick="showPage('govdata')" style="color:var(--teal);cursor:pointer;">Govt Data page</a> for state/national Swachh Bharat figures,
      or <a onclick="gisOpenDistrictAnalytics('${district}')" style="color:var(--teal);cursor:pointer;">view ${district}'s assumption analytics</a>
